sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User / Notebook
    participant P as CallCenterPipeline
    participant W as Whisper
    participant D as pyannote
    participant A as Aligner
    participant G as Groq LLM
    participant R as results/
    U->>P: process_call(call_id, audio)
    P->>W: transcribe(audio)
    W-->>P: text + word timestamps
    P->>D: diarize(audio, num_speakers=2)
    D-->>P: speaker segments (SPEAKER_00/01)
    P->>A: assign words to speakers, build turns
    A-->>P: Speaker 1 / Speaker 2 turns (+ confidence)
    P->>G: opening turns → who is the agent?
    G-->>P: {agent, reason}
    P->>R: save transcripts/call_id.json
    P->>G: transcript → summary prompt
    G-->>P: {issue, action, outcome, summary}
    P->>G: customer turns (start / end) → sentiment prompt
    G-->>P: {labels, justification, evidence}
    P->>R: append summaries.jsonl, sentiment.jsonl
    U->>R: build_final_table() + evaluation
    R-->>U: final_results.csv / .json → Streamlit
